{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"36723","name":"Galeri Resort Hotel","description":"Indulge in a visit to the spa, offering massages, body treatments, and facials. Bask in the sun on the private beach or enjoy other recreational amenities, including a nightclub and an indoor pool. This all-inclusive resort also features complimentary Wi-Fi, concierge services, and an arcade/game room. An area shuttle is available (surcharge). Savor a meal at one of the four on-site restaurants, including Sultan, or take advantage of the 24-hour room service. Unwind with a drink at one of the two bars/lounges or two poolside bars. For business travelers, a 24-hour business center, dry cleaning/laundry services, and a 24-hour front desk are available. The resort offers 2, 152 square feet (200 square meters) of event space, including a conference space and a meeting room. A roundtrip airport shuttle is provided (surcharge, available 24 hours), and free self-parking is available. The 289 air-conditioned guest rooms feature minibars, private balconies or patios, complimentary Wi-Fi, and satellite TV. Private bathrooms include bathtubs or showers, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Nearby attractions include Alara Bazaar (1. 1 mi), Water Planet Aquapark (1. 9 mi), İncekum Plajı (5. 2 mi), Alara Han Castle (8. 4 mi), and Sealanya (9. 2 mi).","address":"Okurcalar Kasabası, Alara Turizm Center","city":"OKURCALAR-ALANYA / ANTALYA","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07415","lat":36.660642,"lng":31.655094,"stars":5,"giataCode":"4576","phone":"+902425274500","email":"info@galerihotel.com","website":"www.galerihotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/036723/036723a_hb_a_014.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/036723/036723a_hb_a_018.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/036723/036723a_hb_a_019.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"htt